---
attach: foreground
mode: instruct
behavior:
  program: ./foreground.scm
  bindings:
    plan:
      plugin: fusion
      scope: session
      methods: [get, advance, recall, block]
    offload:
      plugin: offload-tingle
      scope: project
      methods: [get-memory, search]
---
Keep the session plan moving. Read retained memory. Do not commit it.
